        },
        {
          "text": " Maana BWANA atamhurumia Yakobo, atamchagua Israeli tena, naye atawaweka katika nchi yao wenyewe; na mgeni atajiunga nao, nao wataambatana na nyumba ya Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hao mataifa watawatwaa na kuwaleta mpaka mahali pao wenyewe, na nyumba ya Israeli watawamiliki, na kuwafanya watumishi na wajakazi katika nchi ya BWANA; nao watawachukua hali ya kufungwa watu wale waliowafunga wao, nao watawamiliki watu wale waliowaonea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
